FLASH source distribution

This distribution includes source adapted from RoboVerse:
https://github.com/RoboVerseOrg/RoboVerse

RoboVerse source has been modified to add FLASH and FLASH-G policies,
imitation-learning configurations, demonstration processing, and experiment
launching. Additional distribution edits update documentation, remove local
workflow annotations, and make checkpoint archive storage configurable.

Upstream contributor attribution is retained in CONTRIBUTORS.md. Copyright
and attribution notices in copied components remain in their source files.
Separate license texts for DETR and minGPT are retained with those components.
External simulator assets and datasets are not distributed in this snapshot.
